{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Tales from the Workplace", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Bad Timing", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Gerunds and Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>A <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> is a verb ending with <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> (<span class=\"italic\">doing</span>).<br/>An <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span> is <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + verb (<span class=\"italic\">to do</span>).</p>There are rules about which verbs you can use with <span class=\"strong\">gerunds </span>and which verbs you can use with <span class=\"strong\">infinitives</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Verbs commonly followed by a <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Verbs that express <span class=\"strong\">likes/dislikes</span>:<ul><li>like*</li><li>love</li><li>enjoy*</li><li>dislike</li><li>hate*</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Tom <span class=\"strong\">disliked confronting</span> people about money. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "*<span class=\"italic\">like</span>/<span class=\"italic\">love</span>/<span class=\"italic\">hate</span> can also be followed by an <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Other verbs that are followed by a <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>anticipate</li><li>consider</li><li>delay</li><li>complete</li><li>involve</li><li>suggest</li><li>risk</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Verbs commonly followed by a <span class=\"strong\">infinitives</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>hope</li><li>proceed</li><li>seem</li><li>decide</li><li>start</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">It took several weeks before he <span class=\"strong\">decided to ask</span> Mr. Draper for more money. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You also use <span class=\"strong\">infinitives</span> after <span class=\"strong\">adjectives</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">He was <span class=\"strong\">determined to ask</span> his boss, Mr. Draper, for a pay bump.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using <span class=\"italic\">of course</span> and <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The phrases of course and in fact are discourse markers. <br/> Discourse markers show how ideas are connected. They usually come at the beginning of a sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Discourse markers can show a <span class=\"strong\">connection </span>to what the speaker is saying and what was just said. They can also show what the speaker's <span class=\"strong\">opinion </span>is about what is being said. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the phrase <span class=\"italic\">of course</span> in different ways:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol start=\"1\"><li>To show that you are willing to compromise about what is being said. Perhaps you changed your opinion or are trying to show some agreement with someone else.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">Mr. Draper</span>: If you achieve the financial goal, I'll consider giving you a raise.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I'd would like one earlier. Of course I understand your position, so I will wait.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol start=\"2\"><li>To mean \u201cas everybody knows\u201d or \u201cas is obvious\u201d.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Of course the sun rises in the east.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol start=\"3\"><li>A polite reply to a request. </li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: Could you help me? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Jack</span>: Of course. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the phrase <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span> to emphasize the truth of a situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">In fact, he became so infuriated that he stopped working altogether and went for a walk. </span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to confront", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to talk to someone about a problem", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tom disliked confronting people about money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to cut off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to interrupt someone mid-sentence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He didn't anticipate being cut off so abruptly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pay bump", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a raise; an increase in salary", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was determined to ask his boss, Mr. Draper, for a pay bump.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "infuriated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very angry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In fact, he became so infuriated that he stopped working altogether and went for a walk. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "irresistible", "type": "name"}, {"content": "hard to ignore", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Suddenly Tom had an irresistible desire to tell his boss exactly how he felt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "urge ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "desire", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Suddenly Tom had an irresistible urge to tell his boss exactly how he felt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "determination", "type": "name"}, {"content": "firmness of purpose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tom got up with determination and went into Mr. Draper's office.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine that you are having a very stressful day at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, brainstorm a list of things you can do to make yourself feel better. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your list with some other students.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a poster with suggestions for dealing with stress at work that could be put on the wall of a workplace.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about you poster using expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span> and <span class=\"italic\">of course</span>.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about jobs, work, rules and regulations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span> and <span class=\"italic\">of course</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I produce a poster with suggestions to deal with workplace stress.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le06ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bad Timing </span> <br/> <br/> Tom was a very hard worker who earned a lot of money for his company. He was determined to ask his boss, Mr. Draper, for a pay bump, but he felt uncomfortable about doing so. Tom disliked confronting people about money.  It took several weeks before he decided to ask Mr. Draper for more money."}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob01re2img02.jpg", "time": "18000", "id": 2, "text": "Finally, one Monday morning, Tom went into his boss's office. \u201cExcuse me, Mr. Draper\u201d, he said, \u201cI think I deserve a raise\u201d. Mr. Draper put up his hand and said  \u201cNot now, Tom. Can we do this later?\u201d Tom was so nervous, he just turned around and walked out of the room."}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob01re2img03.jpg", "time": "35500", "id": 3, "text": "Of course, Tom considered going back later, but he started to feel angrier and angrier towards his boss. He didn't anticipate being cut off so abruptly. In fact, he became so infuriated that he stopped working altogether and went for a walk."}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob01re2img03.jpg", "time": "50500", "id": 4, "text": "The fresh air started to clear Tom's head and he began to feel better. He proceeded to regret the way he left Mr. Draper's office.  Suddenly Tom had an irresistible urge to tell his boss exactly how he felt. If necessary, he would quit his job. Tom got up with determination and went into Mr. Draper's office. Draper looked up and smiled. \"Oh Tom,\" he said. \"This is a better time. Now, let's talk about that raise. How much did you have in mind?\""}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le06ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le06ob01re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs, work, rules and regulations. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span> and <span class=\"italic\">of course</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had an experience when something happened and it was just bad timing? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How do you feel towards your boss or teacher? Do they make you nervous? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Bad Timing!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Let's read a story about Tom. How does Tom <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">feel towards</span> his boss?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [